  "description": "A .NET Standard 2.0 library for interacting with KeyCloak's Management API. Provides a similar API structure to Auth0.ManagementApi for easier migration from Auth0 to KeyCloak. Supports user, role, client, and group management operations.",
  "id": "KeyCloak.ManagementApi",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-02-03T16:04:14.717Z",
